# Keep the Docker build context small and reproducible. `turbo prune`
# re-derives exactly what @arena/api needs, so node_modules / build
# outputs from the host are never wanted in the context.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
load-test/results
*.log
